---
type: readme
title: Policy browser tests directory overview
summary: Explains that the directory holds browser tests extending PolicyTest, split out of policy_browsertest.cc into per-area files and later moved here.
---

This directory contains tests which extend PolicyTest class.
//chrome/browser/policy/test/policy_browsertest.cc file used to contain browser tests related to different
policies. These tests were split (crbug.com/40098168) into specialized browser test files testing one area each.
These browser test files were initially placed at //chrome/browser/policy/ and were later moved to
//chrome/browser/policy/test/ to keep the code structure clean.
